# Preview / pre-cutover: keep *.pages.dev out of the index.
# Remove (or scope) before custom-domain go-live when indexing should start.
# Short HTML TTL so production deploys are not stuck behind week-long CDN HIT
# for deleted fixture URLs (s-maxage=604800 was CF Pages default).
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
